# BrokerHub — Full-Stack Web Application Implementation Plan

## Overview

Build a production-quality **B2C BrokerHub** web application based on 3 Figma prototypes comprising **15+ screens** across:
- **Customer-Facing Flow** (landing page, auth, customer dashboard)
- **Broker Auth Flow** (secondary purple-themed BrokerHub registration/login with mobile responsive)
- **Broker Dashboard Portal** (6-screen professional SaaS dashboard)

---

## Design Analysis Summary

### Color Palette (from Figma)

| Token | Value | Usage |
|-------|-------|-------|
| Primary Green | `#10B981` / `#2DD4A8` | CTA buttons, active nav items, links, badges |
| Dark Navy | `#0F172A` | Footer, heading text, dark backgrounds |
| Light Gray BG | `#F5F7FA` | Page backgrounds, auth pages |
| White | `#FFFFFF` | Cards, content areas |
| Card Border | `#E5E7EB` | Card borders, table dividers |
| Text Primary | `#1E293B` | Headings |
| Text Secondary | `#64748B` | Body text, descriptions |
| Status Green | `#10B981` | Delivered, Connected |
| Status Yellow | `#F59E0B` | Under Review, In Transit |
| Status Red | `#EF4444` | Pending, Cancelled |
| Status Blue | `#3B82F6` | Pending Match, info |
| Purple/Indigo | `#6366F1` | BrokerHub auth flow (prototype 2) |

### Typography
- **Font Family**: Inter (Google Font)
- **Headings**: Bold, 24–36px
- **Body**: Regular/Medium, 14–16px
- **Labels**: Medium, 12–14px

