## Build Order

1. **Phase 1**: Project setup, Tailwind config, design tokens, types, mock data
2. **Phase 2**: Reusable UI components (Button, Input, StatCard, StatusBadge, etc.)
3. **Phase 3**: Layout components (Navbar, Sidebars, Headers, Footer, Layout wrappers)
4. **Phase 4**: Landing Page + Auth Pages (Login, SignUp, BrokerAuth)
5. **Phase 5**: Customer Dashboard + Customer pages
6. **Phase 6**: Broker Dashboard + all 5 broker sub-pages
7. **Phase 7**: Responsive refinement + polish + accessibility

